|               |           RepartitionExec: partitioning=Hash([NumberSid@0], 32), input_partitions=32                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |             SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |               BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |                 DataSourceExec: file_groups={32 groups: [[/data/number_caps/<CAYENNE_PATH>.vortex:<RANGE>], [/data/number_caps/<CAYENNE_PATH>.vortex:<RANGE>], [/data/number_caps/<CAYENNE_PATH>.vortex:<RANGE>], [/data/number_caps/<CAYENNE_PATH>.vortex:<RANGE>], [/data/number_caps/<CAYENNE_PATH>.vortex:<RANGE>], ...]}, projection=[NumberSid, Capability], file_type=vortex, predicate: Capability@1 = sms AND NumberSid@0 != PN00000000000000000000000000000099                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
